# prose-audit: Grade A — The opening establishes our returned caucus, internal bargain, opposition role and monthly political rhythm in one voice, then offers an optional nine-page briefing that runs from the SLD's 1993–2005 summit through the Fourth Republic, the Tusk years, Smoleńsk, our own 2015 collapse and the near horizon before any card is drawn.
title: Red Autumn
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
if (!Array.isArray(Q.poll_history) || !Q.poll_history.length) {
    Q.poll_history = [{
        date: "2019-10-01",
        label: "October 2019",
        left: Number(Q.left_poll) || 0,
        pis: Number(Q.pis_poll) || 0,
        ko: Number(Q.ko_poll) || 0,
        psl: Number(Q.psl_poll) || 0,
        p2050: Number(Q.p2050_poll) || 0,
        p0: Number(Q.p0_poll) || 0,
        konf: Number(Q.konf_poll) || 0,
        other: Number(Q.other_poll) || 0
